Homepage: https://www.rust-lang.org/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Rust programming language - default version
 Puts rustc and cargo on PATH, pointing at the Rust 1.98 toolchain. The wrappers
 supply SDKROOT, because there is no xcrun on the device and rustc otherwise
 warns on every invocation that it cannot find the iPhoneOS SDK.
